# local env files
# SECURITY FIX: previously only .env*.local was ignored, so the real .env
# file (which contains live secrets like the MUX secret key) was NOT
# excluded from git. If this project is ever pushed to git, even a private
# repo, that file gets committed and the secrets are exposed in history
# forever, even if later deleted. Now ALL .env variants are ignored except
# the example template, which should contain no real values.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo

node_modules
android/.gradle
android/build
android/app/builde
/android
ios/build
*.log
archive.tar.gz
archive.tar.gz/
download-skia/
gradlew-log.txt
*.tar.gz
